# Secrets — never commit API keys or tokens. The dataset pipeline that needed
# them is no longer published with the site (see README), so nothing here
# writes one any more; these stay as a backstop, because this directory is
# served verbatim from a CDN and anything committed into it is public the
# moment it deploys.
.env
.env.*
*.secret
*.local.json

